  (text "U101/U201/U301/U401: pin 17 / SRB1\nMISC1.SRB1 = 1; SRB2 remains unused.\nTP7 measures the filtered shared reference."
    (at 242 57 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "8575892a-6f1e-4ddf-ba03-f87f1497cc77"))
  (text "Unbuffered shared REF retained: validate aggregate input loading and lead-off configuration for 32 channels.\nOne common REF filter; do not add 32 parallel filter capacitors to this electrode.\nTI EVM default directly selects REF_ELEC to SRB1 (JP8); its optional buffer is not populated here."
    (at 20 98 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "ab9b8426-ce3e-4a63-9d04-6d75e8f99fa1"))
  (text "U101 BIASOUT, pin 63\nExisting 1M || 1nF feedback\nremains before R634."
    (at 25 156 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "56ce3dd4-f0fb-4395-a9df-2aed7f8e9c31"))
  (text "J601.34 / separate BIAS electrode\n4.99k is TI EVM R10 value; it is not\na validated patient-current limiter."
    (at 215 156 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "eec86a79-0e17-4761-bdc1-bf32878ba5a8"))
  (text "FIRMWARE + VALIDATION"
    (at 20 189 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.7 1.7)
        (bold yes))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a10025d9-9b5e-4ca2-8eb3-1c08c6415897"))
  (text "Enable only U101 BIAS amplifier; slave BIASOUT pins remain NC. Preserve shared BIAS_SUM and BIASIN.\nSelect BIAS sense channels deliberately. Validate stability with electrode/cable impedance and disconnect faults.\nAt +5VA, internal BIASREF targets mid-supply. REF is neither GND nor the ADS VREFP conversion reference.\nCommon clock + shared START synchronize all four devices. Configure identical 500 SPS rates.\nLead-off excitation and gain/DC-offset range require bench verification with passive electrode models."
    (at 20 201 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.35 1.35))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a28c8b46-275b-4f79-b2a8-cac8f1d8aac9"))
  (text "PROTECTION RELEASE HOLD: RC networks reduce input current/EMI but do not establish ESD, defibrillator,\nisolation, leakage or single-fault safety. No human connection until supervisor/electrical safety validation."
    (at 20 251 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.35 1.35)
        (bold yes))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "dbb2f419-3831-4223-88df-89f8488c3c0b")))
